    "name": "Chetan",
    "age": 22
}


Read
student["name"]


Add
student["city"] = "Nagpur"


Update
student["age"] = 23


Delete
del student["age"]


Interview Question
Dictionary vs List
List:
skills[0]

Dictionary:
student["name"]


