Python:
self


14. Encapsulation

Definition
Binding data and methods together and restricting direct access.
self.__balance


Benefits
Security
Data Hiding
Controlled Access

15. Inheritance

Definition
Acquiring properties and methods from another class.
class Car(Vehicle):


Benefits
Reusability
Maintainability
Extensibility

16. Polymorphism

Definition
One interface, many forms.

Method Overriding
class Dog(Animal):

    def sound(self):
        print("Bark")


Runtime Polymorphism
Same method.
Different behavior.

17. Abstraction

Definition
Hide implementation details and show only essential features.

Real World Example
ATM
Car
Mobile Phone
Coffee Machine


Abstract Class
from abc import ABC


Interview Question
Encapsulation vs Abstraction
Encapsulation
Hide Data
Abstraction
Hide Implementation

